firstfarms��Based on the recent decrease in pig prices, and changed expectations for prices
throughout the year, and drought in Slovakia and Hungary, which is expected to
reduce the crop yields by 25 % compared to the expectations, FirstFarms adjusts
downwards the previous announced expectations for 2026 by 45 mDKK to an EBITDA
in the level of 15 – 65 mDKK and an EBIT of minus 55 – 5 mDKK.

The crops in Romania are in general good condition, where FirstFarms has more
than 2,000 hectares under irrigation. In addition, there have also been good
conditions for crops without irrigation, and good yields are therefore expected.

Announced expectations 2026
EBITDA EBIT
8 July 2026 15 – 65 mDKK minus 55 – 5 mDKK
25 March 2026 60 – 110 mDKK -10 – +40 mDKK

